    },
    {
      "text": "Combine oats, butter, cinnamon, brown sugar, and vanilla in a bowl. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon out some of the flesh of the peaches. Place peaches skin side up in air fryer basket. Air fry for 5 minutes. Turn peaches over and spoon 1/2 tablespoon of the oat mixture into each cavity. Air fry until oats are golden brown and crispy, 2 to 3 minutes more.",
